   "design": "The permit register marks permits reported lost or stolen, so the handheld flags them when checked, instead of the officer reading a list each shift. The officer checks the permit number and reason and marks a seized permit on the handheld, and the permit office gets it at once, instead of a phone call. Inspecting, checking, comparing, seizing, talking with owners, the citation, the report, signing and sending stay with the officer.",
